  (text "ISO_EN follows Q1_EN only. Unpowered backfeed is blocked when Q1 is off.\\nP08/FAULT_N is a diagnostic output from the hardware latch. It is not an enable input.\\nUID and I2C may inhibit training in firmware; they cannot override an open S1 or S2."
    (at 25.400 160.000 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "17ff353e-bf1f-555f-af61-dc0e492f5f81")
